1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,824
Goalkeepers who hid

2
00:00:00,824 --> 00:00:01,358
a cheat sheet

3
00:00:01,358 --> 00:00:01,997
in their sock.

4
00:00:01,997 --> 00:00:03,100
Back in 2006,

5
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:04,133
Germany hosted the World

6
00:00:04,133 --> 00:00:05,329
Cup, and in the quarterfinal

7
00:00:05,329 --> 00:00:06,281
they faced Argentina

8
00:00:06,281 --> 00:00:06,838
in Berlin.

9
00:00:06,838 --> 00:00:08,081
After 120 minutes

10
00:00:08,081 --> 00:00:08,638
it was still

11
00:00:08,638 --> 00:00:09,787
1-1, so the game

12
00:00:09,787 --> 00:00:10,588
went to penalties.

13
00:00:10,588 --> 00:00:11,563
But Germany's keeper,

14
00:00:11,563 --> 00:00:12,492
Jens Lehmann, had

15
00:00:12,492 --> 00:00:13,015
a secret.

16
00:00:13,015 --> 00:00:13,862
His goalkeeping coach,

17
00:00:13,862 --> 00:00:14,861
Andreas Köpke, had

18
00:00:14,861 --> 00:00:15,964
studied where Argentina's

19
00:00:15,964 --> 00:00:16,858
players liked to shoot,

20
00:00:16,858 --> 00:00:17,322
and the tips

21
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:18,111
ended up on a tiny

22
00:00:18,111 --> 00:00:18,854
page from the team

23
00:00:18,854 --> 00:00:19,644
hotel's notepad.

24
00:00:19,644 --> 00:00:20,689
Riquelme, left high.

25
00:00:20,689 --> 00:00:21,792
Heinze, left low.

26
00:00:21,792 --> 00:00:23,106
Even Messi was on it.

27
00:00:23,106 --> 00:00:24,047
Lehmann tucked the paper

28
00:00:24,047 --> 00:00:24,720
into his sock.

29
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,707
And before Argentina's

30
00:00:25,707 --> 00:00:26,334
kicks, he kept

31
00:00:26,334 --> 00:00:26,845
pulling it out

32
00:00:26,845 --> 00:00:27,425
to read it,

33
00:00:27,425 --> 00:00:27,820
right in front

34
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,726
of the whole stadium.

35
00:00:28,726 --> 00:00:29,434
But there was one

36
00:00:29,434 --> 00:00:30,072
big problem.

37
00:00:30,072 --> 00:00:30,873
Only two of the players

38
00:00:30,873 --> 00:00:31,280
on his list

39
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,209
actually took a penalty.

40
00:00:32,209 --> 00:00:32,905
He saved Roberto

41
00:00:32,905 --> 00:00:33,753
Ayala's, and he

42
00:00:33,753 --> 00:00:34,647
nearly saved Maxi

43
00:00:34,647 --> 00:00:35,390
Rodríguez's.

44
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:36,121
Then came the kick

45
00:00:36,121 --> 00:00:36,690
that would decide

46
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:37,201
everything.

47
00:00:37,201 --> 00:00:38,490
Esteban Cambiasso walked

48
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:38,942
up, and his

49
00:00:38,942 --> 00:00:39,558
name was nowhere

50
00:00:39,558 --> 00:00:40,162
on that paper.

51
00:00:40,162 --> 00:00:40,893
So Lehmann pulled

52
00:00:40,893 --> 00:00:41,648
it out anyway.

53
00:00:41,648 --> 00:00:42,136
He read it,

54
00:00:42,136 --> 00:00:42,704
nodded, and put

55
00:00:42,704 --> 00:00:43,285
it away, like

56
00:00:43,285 --> 00:00:44,051
he knew exactly

57
00:00:44,051 --> 00:00:44,759
what was coming.

58
00:00:44,759 --> 00:00:46,083
Cambiasso shot, and Lehmann

59
00:00:46,083 --> 00:00:46,629
saved it.

60
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:47,743
Germany won 4-2.

61
00:00:47,743 --> 00:00:48,463
But here's the wild

62
00:00:48,463 --> 00:00:48,776
part.

63
00:00:48,776 --> 00:00:49,496
After the game,

64
00:00:49,496 --> 00:00:50,390
Lehmann found the note

65
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:51,087
lying on the dressing

66
00:00:51,087 --> 00:00:51,748
room floor, next

67
00:00:51,748 --> 00:00:52,515
to his socks.

68
00:00:52,515 --> 00:00:53,455
Months later, the boss

69
00:00:53,455 --> 00:00:53,896
of a German

70
00:00:53,896 --> 00:00:54,686
energy company bought

71
00:00:54,686 --> 00:00:55,185
it for one

72
00:00:55,185 --> 00:00:56,427
million euros, at a charity

73
00:00:56,427 --> 00:00:57,252
auction for children.

74
00:00:57,252 --> 00:00:58,204
One million euros,

75
00:00:58,204 --> 00:00:58,726
for a page

76
00:00:58,726 --> 00:00:59,747
from a hotel notepad.

77
00:00:59,747 --> 00:01:00,154
And my next

78
00:01:00,154 --> 00:01:00,664
video is about

79
00:01:00,664 --> 00:01:01,431
the fire at Mario

80
00:01:01,431 --> 00:01:02,580
Balotelli's house, the day

81
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:03,718
before the Manchester derby.

82
00:01:03,718 --> 00:01:04,333
Follow if you want

83
00:01:04,333 --> 00:01:05,099
the algorithm to show

84
00:01:05,099 --> 00:01:05,715
it to you.
